#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-B expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "The -B/-D PARTITION BOUNDARY, pinned: same five wildcard families as the violation fixture, so NoMatch is not the cause. Declared BDS beats the columns (Fix #154), so the dataset is outside [SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET] and -B never runs. Sibling PMDA-AD0252-D, which owns the BDS partition, would fire on this same dataset."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col AVAL     type=Num
col AOCC01FL type=Char
col TRTEM1FL type=Char
col TREM01FL type=Char
col ACAT1    type=Char
col LBORG1   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 30 | Y | Y | Y | CAT1 | ORGA
